    "detailed_description": "It is an open-world third-person game that takes place in the late 1970s. The protagonist is Alex, who comes from a poor family and by this reason, from an innocent child ends up being part of a criminal organization from a young age. But, after the unfortunate death of his father, Alex loses his loyalty and, regardless of the consequences, he wants to take his revenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlong with a rich storyline, accompanied by missions full of action and intrigue, we encourage players to explore the world of the 20th century, in an urban environment but not devoid of nature, and to take part in the diversity of activities: car races, gambling, underground fights and many exciting side guests. Discover unique outfits and hairstyles, modify and customize weapons and cars with a classic touch.",
